Package: daisychain
Type: Package
Title: AFLW Data Analysis and Predictive Modeling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Pete", "O'Reilly",
      email = "pete@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A comprehensive package for Australian Football League Women's (AFLW)
    data collection, analysis, and predictive modeling. Provides functions for
    scraping AFLW data, analyzing player contributions to game margins, building
    player rating systems, and creating match prediction models for totals,
    margins, and win probabilities.
